              <p>Pass the best estimator, <c>X</c>, and <c>y</c> to <c>plot_svc</c> and compare it with the manually chosen models.</p>
            </hint>
            <hint>
              <p><alert>Common error:</alert> Do not hard-code the earlier <m>C=1,\gamma=1</m> model after the search chose a different <m>\gamma</m>.</p>
            </hint>
            <answer>
              <program language="python">
                <code>
                  best_svm = clf.best_estimator_
                  print(clf.best_params_)
                  plot_svc(best_svm, X, y)
